▶ JWT claim decoding
  ✔ reads the payload of a base64url ES256 token (3.2765ms)
  ✔ refuses to invent claims from a non-token (0.7275ms)
✔ JWT claim decoding (4.6486ms)
▶ Token freshness
  ✔ a token inside the skew window must be refreshed before it is sent (0.762ms)
  ✔ a token with time to spare is sent as-is (0.6023ms)
  ✔ an exp-less token is not treated as expired (0.5173ms)
✔ Token freshness (2.5256ms)
▶ currentAccessToken
  ✔ returns the stored token untouched while it is still valid (3.3146ms)
  ✔ refreshes a token that would expire mid-request (0.9722ms)
  ✔ a refresh that yields nothing ends the session instead of sending a doomed token (0.7453ms)
  ✔ nobody signed in means no token, not a stand-in token (0.453ms)
  ✔ an unconfigured provider gives no token (0.2099ms)
✔ currentAccessToken (6.226ms)
▶ Sign-in refusal messages
  ✔ an unconfigured provider refuses rather than succeeding quietly (0.6573ms)
  ✔ bad credentials are reported as bad credentials (0.3944ms)
  ✔ an unconfirmed reviewer account says what to do about it (0.3189ms)
  ✔ an unreachable provider is not reported as a wrong password (0.3102ms)
  ✔ a provider sign-in error never returns a session (0.2991ms)
  ✔ a successful provider sign-in hands back its session (0.5359ms)
✔ Sign-in refusal messages (2.8741ms)
▶ Session subscription
  ✔ pushes the provider session to the handler and can unsubscribe (0.6488ms)
  ✔ an unconfigured provider still returns a callable unsubscribe (0.2373ms)
✔ Session subscription (1.1388ms)
▶ No fabricated identity survives in the frontend source
  ✔ no file reads or writes a token from localStorage (95.4351ms)
✔ No fabricated identity survives in the frontend source (95.6355ms)
